Package: pharmr.extra
Title: Extension of pharmr (Pharmpy) functionality
Version: 0.0.0.9068
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ron", "Keizer", email = "ron@insight-rx.com", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Michael", "McCarthy", email = "michael.mccarthy@insight-rx.com", role = "ctb"),
    person("InsightRX", role = "cph")
  )
Author: Ron Keizer
Maintainer: Ron Keizer <ron@insight-rx.com>
Description: Provides functions that provide extensions and workarounds for
    pharmr / Pharmpy. The goal of the package is to provide functionality that is
    not (yet) available within Pharmpy, and for some existing functionality provide
    more stable alternatives.
